  "Specification": "Yo-Yo distributed leader-election algorithm with the pruning optimization, parameterized so that TLC can verify it for every undirected, loop-free, connected graph over a fixed number N of nodes. Encodes down/up phases, edge reversal and pruning, and verifies type correctness, the NeighborInv invariant, eventual termination (Liveness = <>Termination) and FinishIffTerminated (the only deadlock state is the terminated one).",
